The demon breaks down the door and you begin to recite the incantation. The room's temperature rises, your body becomes soaked in sweat as you continue reading. #id:31

Do you really think empty words can hold me back??? I AM AZAZEL, PRINCE OF HELL, you are NOTHING at my feet. #id:32

While he speaks, you can perceive your grandparents repeating the same words as you from inside the Eggwatch. Even while crying, you don't stop reading. The demon lets out a loud scream, leaps towards you, entering the circle, and a bright light blinds you once more. #id:33

Your grandparents are back, the demon has vanished, and you are greeted with a warm embrace, as if you had woken from a terrible nightmare. Later that day, you discover that your family comes from a lineage of exorcists. #id:34